# server/

The udex-server crate providing the gRPC server implementation with service handlers, middleware, authorization enforcement, TLS support, and configuration management. Houses the library code, integration tests, and performance benchmarks.

## Dirs

- `benches/` -- Criterion performance benchmarks for gRPC service request latency and throughput
- `src/` -- Core gRPC server implementation with service handlers, JWT authz, config, and logging
- `tests/` -- Integration tests with OAuth2 fixtures, JWT key material, and TLS certificates

## Files

- `Cargo.toml` -- Package definition with dependencies for gRPC, TLS, JWT, and structured logging
- `README.md` -- Crate overview, module responsibilities, authorization architecture, and server configuration
